            "notes": "At this point, you should actually be able to get all purple, but if you don't the slot is pretty flexible.  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) and  [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) are great items for you since you will be taking many damage instances playing in front of your shield (so you're damage reduction stacks from ogundimu will stay high) and if people get into your melee range to brawl you can play around shield while meleeing to get even higher survivability, its' basically a trap.",
