        {
            "id": "816c3155-6a8d-4602-affc-2f33cb62bcfa",
            "build_id": "05a3221d-920b-478d-8920-c3cf9b39a968",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-06T22:55:22.206949+00:00",
            "notes": "[Astrophysical](item_7749452f-3c0e-45a9-9c32-f561aa7fb41e) may seem like a weird power, but it's actually crazy. It hits through Orisa FORTIFY (this HAS to be a bug). It can get literally anyone off point and make them a stupid easy target. It can also disrupt ability or ult usage and is almost always unexpected.\n\n [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) with  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) means that whenever you get hit, you get 10% damage reduction for 3 seconds, which has crazy stackability with your shield, passive, and melee regen.\n\nWith that said, Nebula Conduit may not be optimal due to the passive applied with damage; this is still being experimented with.\n\nThe best part about this build is that if you get super low, you should almost always still have absorb, and by the time that's over, you'll have shield back and most of your HP from passive regen.",
            "stats": {
                "LIFE": 374,
                "Armor": 115,
